      <title>EuroMillions results LIVE: Winning numbers for £113m 'super' jackpot prize in February 20 draw</title>
      <link>https://www.nottinghampost.com/news/uk-world-news/euromillions-results-live-winning-numbers-10828014</link>
      <description>The EuroMillions draw tonight (Friday 20) could see one lucky winner walk away with the super jackpot - a whopping £113million. The draw, taking place at 8.45pm, has the potential to change everything for a lucky winner.To be in with a chance to win, players pay £2.50 and select five main numbers from 1 to 50, along with two Lucky Stars from 1 to 12. If you match all five main numbers and both Lucky Stars drawn you win the EuroMillions jackpot.We'll bring you all the live updates as they happen.</description>
